Run without default provider installed.
Call PEM_read_bio_PrivateKey (or any of the PEM loading functions).

Watch pem_read_bio_key_decoder get stuck in an infinite loop.

```
52          while (!OSSL_DECODER_from_bio(dctx, bp) || pkey == NULL)
53              if (BIO_eof(bp) != 0)
54                  goto err;
```

